{"id":"n53746-3-8","stage":0,"title":"떠나다 · 离开、离职","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n53746-3-8-1","ko":"요즘 왜 이렇게 힘이 없어요?","zh":"最近怎么这么没力气啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"힘이","meaning":"精神、力气","explanation":"힘：力气、精神；힘이 없다 表示没精神、没力气。","readings":[{"term":"힘","audio":"/audio/68de24edc341fabd21d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28633","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘이","audio":"/audio/748f97ff6aa7a31c4ea0.mp3"}},{"text":"없어요?","meaning":"没精神","explanation":"힘이 없다 表示没精神；-어요? 是礼貌疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어요","audio":"/audio/a3a387384b956d187d4f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"68de24edc341fabd","term":"힘","zh":"力气、精神","audio":"/audio/68de24edc341fabd21d4.mp3","entryId":"28633","definition":"体力或精神上的力量；힘이 없다 表示没力气、没精神。","pronunciation":["힘"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d9b8336d2f0b6e422ec7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n53746-3-8-2","ko":"동료들이 하나둘씩 직장을 떠나서.","zh":"因为同事们一个接一个地离职了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"동료들이","meaning":"同事，同僚","explanation":"동료：同事，同僚；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"동료","audio":"/audio/60cd6085b9cc16cf20e2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14802","senseId":"1","lemma":"동료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동료들이","audio":"/audio/cd11637437fabdce1e5e.mp3"}},{"text":"하나둘씩","meaning":"一个接一个地","explanation":"하나둘：一个、两个；-씩 表示逐个分配或依次发生，这里指同事陆续离职。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"},{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"34869","senseId":"1","lemma":"둘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나둘씩","audio":"/audio/5f4f26c9d10d3f63497a.mp3"}},{"text":"직장을","meaning":"工作单位","explanation":"직장：工作单位；-을 标记 떠나다 的宾语。","readings":[{"term":"직장","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58297","senseId":"1","lemma":"직장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"직장을","audio":"/audio/b79a67e2f0defe312858.mp3"}},{"text":"떠나서.","meaning":"离职了，所以……","explanation":"떠나다：离开；직장을 떠나다 指离开工作单位、离职；-아서 在这里交代没精神的原因。","readings":[{"term":"떠나다","audio":"/audio/9ee56e8783da00e3fbed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53746","senseId":"3","lemma":"떠나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떠나서","audio":"/audio/c1abd578e52b3dd9bfc7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"60cd6085b9cc16cf","term":"동료","zh":"同事，同僚","audio":"/audio/60cd6085b9cc16cf20e2.mp3","entryId":"14802","definition":"在同一单位工作的人。","pronunciation":["동뇨"]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"一、一个","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20279","definition":"数词“一”；하나둘씩 在这里合起来表示一个接一个地。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"ca76b1284fc2088d","term":"둘","zh":"二、两个","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3","entryId":"34869","definition":"数词“二”；하나둘씩 在这里合起来表示一个接一个地。","pronunciation":["둘ː"]},{"id":"fdfb4ffae29b3def","term":"직장","zh":"工作单位，职场","audio":"/audio/fdfb4ffae29b3defcce4.mp3","entryId":"58297","definition":"指收取报酬而上班的地方。","pronunciation":["직짱"]},{"id":"9ee56e8783da00e3","term":"떠나다","zh":"离开、离职","audio":"/audio/9ee56e8783da00e3fbed.mp3","entryId":"53746","definition":"离开原来所在的地方或关系；직장을 떠나다 在这里指离职。","pronunciation":["떠나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9e0815d69ab70552a553.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.87,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=53746","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":28,"sequenceScore":1.2288,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为同事们一个接一个地离职了。","您熟悉李部长吗？","最近怎么这么没力气啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为同事们一个接一个地离职了。","最近怎么这么没力气啊？","您熟悉李部长吗？"],"answer":0}]}
